
# ERD.png
Database schema diagram (Entity-Relationship)
This diagram illustrates all core entities and their relationships as designed in PHASE1_SYSTEM_DESIGN:

Entities:
- Schools
- Users (Teacher / Student)
- Exams
- Item Bank
- Exam Items
- Responses
- Results

Relationships:
- One School has many Users
- Teachers create Exams
- Exams contain multiple Exam Items from the Item Bank
- Students submit Responses per Exam Item
- Responses generate Results (auto-graded for MCQ / TF)
